## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Flicker Engage (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Dominance Ice, Rose Gold Meteor, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light and Valor will decide the first two waves.; Athena's Shield over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when burst magic can remove you before Queen's Wings and Body of Smith can stabilize the entry.; Antique Cuirass over Rose Gold Meteor when Use against repeated physical skill burst from fighters or assassins that must hit you before the carry is exposed.; Oracle over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when extra received healing and shielding matter more than Rose Gold Meteor's low-HP shield and hybrid defense.
- Total cost: 11000 gold

Default EXP setup for games where Terizla must create the first catch with Flicker plus Penalty Zone, then convert low-HP passives into a second hammer cycle.

### EXP Vengeance Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate, Radiant Armor, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when the enemy front line or marksman depends on shield, HP regen, or attack speed to win the brawl.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-shot magic burst instead of repeated magic poke.; Blade Armor over Radiant Armor when Use when a basic-attack marksman must hit you during Vengeance before your back line can answer.; Rose Gold Meteor over Radiant Armor when Use against mixed burst when the Lifeline shield and decaying movement speed give more value than stacked magic defense.; Antique Cuirass over Radiant Armor when Use when physical skill damage is the main threat and your team needs you to stand in the first contact.
- Total cost: 10920 gold

Durable setup for drafts where the enemy damage has to hit Terizla and Vengeance buys more value than a longer engage angle.

### EXP Anti-Sustain Wall (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Dominance Ice, Queen's Wings, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Dominance Ice, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when magic damage or control chains matter more than physical lane trades.; Oracle over Antique Cuirass when Use when enemy sustain is already controlled and extra healing plus hybrid defense will extend every hammer cycle.; Rose Gold Meteor over Antique Cuirass when Use when mixed damage and low-HP shield value matter more than reducing repeated physical skill hits.; Radiant Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks during Lord and inhibitor fights.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when a basic-attack carry is forced to hit you before reaching your back line.
